# This project currently reads zero environment variables in its own code —
# there's no database, no authentication, and no secret keys yet, so there's
# nothing to configure here. This file exists as a placeholder for when that
# changes (e.g. a SECRET_KEY once session-based features are added).
#
# The one environment variable this project depends on is PORT, but it's
# supplied by Render automatically at deploy time and consumed directly by
# the gunicorn start command (see README.md) — not read by the app itself,
# so it isn't listed as a variable to set here.
